        "original_id": "2db44bfd-eeac-5353-97d3-47b514ac0cf9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: 43d Air Mobility Operations Group, Air Mobility Command, USAF Expeditionary Center, United States Army\n- Places: Pope Field, Fort Bragg, North Carolina, Pope AFB\n\nFacts:\n- The 43d Air Mobility Operations Group is an active duty air mobility unit at Pope Field in Fort Bragg, North Carolina.\n- Pope Field was formerly known as Pope AFB.\n- The 43d Air Mobility Operations Group is part of the Air Mobility Command USAF Expeditionary Center.\n- Fort Bragg in North Carolina is a military installation of the United States Army.\n- Fort Bragg has more than 50,000 active duty personnel and is the world's largest military installation by population.",
